                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "EDIT: as of Late no news or Patches are announced or seemingly planned, therefore you should avoid a purchase for now.\n\n\nThis is an Earl Access review of this game.\n\nFull disclosure: Im helping these guys out in some of their beta testing and have played some of the version before this EA build.\n\nIn general the Game has a very interesting premise and shows a lot of potential. It can be a very fun and engaging already.\n\nIts a hard game and if you like a challenge this may be the game for you. \n\nThe game Focusses more on managment of your ressources than on Combat and is in itself a very unique and innovative gameplay.\nnaturally since it is still in early Access its still very rough around the Edges but the general gameplay is already implemented and quite extensive.\n\nin the end it will depend on the further development but i can certainly recommend giving this a try if you are ready to engage yourself in a beta version of a game.\n\nThe developers definitely show a lot of respect for Feedback and ideas and are engaging with any input coming their way.",
